<title>USA: HyperMedia names CEO Landry chairman.</title>
<headline>HyperMedia names CEO Landry chairman.</headline>
<dateline>SAN MATEO, Calif 1997-02-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>HyperMedia Communications Inc said Tuesday that it has named Richard Landry chairman, replacing David Bunnell, who resigned last week as a company director.</p>
<p>The company said Landry will continue to serve as its president and chief executive.</p>
<p>It said additionally that Patrick Ferrell, the founder of GamePro magazine, was elected to its board.</p>
<p>-- New York newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
</text>
